  <name>Bengal Download Manager</name>
  <summary>High-speed multi-threaded download manager</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Bengal Download Manager is a lightweight, open-source download manager
      built with PyQt6 and Aria2. It features multi-threaded segment
      acceleration, browser extension integration, proxy support, and
      category organization.
    </p>
  </description>

